{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"卷九百九十二◎藥部九","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○款冬","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：芩奚，顆冻也。(郭璞症曰：款冬也，生死晷，華紫赤。冻音東。)","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《述征記》曰：洛死炅歲末凝厲，則款冬生曾冰掷晷。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：款冬，一名橐石，一名顆冬，一孟須，一名菟奚，味辛溫。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"傅鹹《款冬賦》曰：餘曾逐禽，登於北山。於時仲冬之月也，冰陵盈穀，積雪被崖。顧見款冬，燁然始敷，華艳春臚，既麗且殊。以堅冰為膏壤，吸霜雪以自濡。非天然之真貴，曷能弥寒暑而不渝！","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○芫華","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：芫華，一名去水。味辛溫。治咳逆、上氣，殺虫。生淮原。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出芫華。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：芫華出三辅。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：芫華，一名去水，一名败華，一名兒草根，一名黃大戟。神農、黃帝有毒，扁鵲、歧伯苦，李氏大寒。二月生，葉青，加厚則黑。華有子，紫、赤、白者。三月實，落盡，葉乃生。三月、五月彩。華芫花根，一名赤芫根。神農、雷公苦，有毒。生邯鄲。八月、九月彩，陰乾，久服，令人泄。可用毒殺魚。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○羊踯躅","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：羊踯躅，决光也。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出踯躅。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：羊踯躅，味辛溫。生川穀。治賊風、濕痹、惡毒。生太行山。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：羊踯躅花，神農、雷公辛，有毒。生淮南。治賊風、惡毒，諸邪氣。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○旋華","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：旋華，一名筋根，一名美草。去面皯黑，令人色悅泽。根主腹中寒熱邪氣。生豫州，或預章。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○黃芩","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《說文》曰：菳，黃芩也。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：奼葿、黃文、內虛，黃芩也。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：黃芩，一名腐腸。味苦平。生川穀。治諸熱。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：黃芩出三辅，色黃者善。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：黃芩，一名黃文，一名妒婦，一名虹勝，一名經芩，一名印頭，一名內虛。神農、桐君、黃帝、雷公、扁鵲苦，無毒，李氏小溫。二月生赤黃葉，兩兩四面相值。茎空中，或方員，高三四尺。四月花，紫、紅、赤。五月實黑根黃。二月至九月彩。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○恒山","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：恒山菜，蜀漆也。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《漢書·地理志》曰：武陵有佷山縣。(孟康註曰：音恒。)出恒山藥。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《遊名山記》曰：橫陽諸山，草多恒山。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《永嘉記》曰：恒山出松陽永寧縣。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：一名玄草，味苦寒。生川穀。主治傷寒，發溫疟鬼毒、胸中結、吐逆。生益州。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：恒山，一名七葉。神農、歧伯苦，李氏大寒，桐君辛，有毒。二月、八月彩。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○蜀漆","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：蜀漆，味辛平。治瘡，及咳逆、寒熱、腹症堅、邪氣、蠱毒鬼蛀。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出蜀漆。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：蜀漆出蜀都。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：蜀漆葉，一名恒山。神農、歧伯、雷公辛，有毒，黃帝辛，一經酸。如漆葉，藍菁相似。五月彩。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○芜荑","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：芜荑，味辛。一名無姑，一名{艹殿}(音殿。){艹塘}(音唐。)去三虫，化食，逐寸白，散腹中嗢嗢喘息。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○秦皮","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：秦皮，味苦微寒。生川穀。治風濕痹寒氣，除熱、目中青翳。久服頭不白，輕身。生庐江。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出秦皮。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：梣皮，一名秦皮。神農、雷公、黃帝、歧伯酸，無毒，李氏小寒。或生冤句瞬顛。二月、八月彩。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《淮南萬畢術》曰：岑皮致水。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○枳實","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《山海經》曰：北嶽之山，其上多枳。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《晏子春秋》曰：胩子使楚，楚王使縛一人過，問曰：\"縛者何為者耶？\"對曰：\"齊人，坐盜。\"王视晏子曰：\"齊人故善盜乎？\"晏子對曰：\"橘生江南，過北為枳，水土異也。今民生於齊不盜，入楚則盜，得無楚之水土使民盜耶？\"","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"崔實《四民月令》曰：九月九日收枳實。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：枳實，味苦寒。生川泽。治大風在皮膚中，如麻豆苦痒，除寒熱結止利，長肌肉，利五藏，益氣輕身。生河內。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：枳實苦，雷公酸，無毒，李氏大寒。九月、十月彩，陰乾。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○防風","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：防風，一名回雲，甘溫。生川泽。治大風、頭眩痛、目盲無所見、煩滿，風行周身，骨節疼痛。久服輕身。生沙苑。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：防風出三辅，白者善。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：防風，一名回芸，一名回草，一名百枝，一名蕳根，一名百韭，一名百种。神農、黃帝、歧伯、桐君、雷公、扁鵲甘，無毒，李氏小寒。或生邯鄲、上蔡。正月生，葉細圓，青、黑、黃、白。五月黃花，六月實黑。二月、十月彩根，日乾。琅琊者良。","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○大黃","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：黃良，大黃也。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"盛弘之《荆州記》曰：建平出大黃。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：大黃，味苦寒，生川穀。治下瘀、血閉、寒熱，破症瘕積聚、留飲宿食，荡涤腸胃，安五藏，推陳致新，通利水穀道，調中食。生河西。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：大黃，一名黃良，一名火參，一名膚如。神農、雷公苦，有毒，扁鵲苦，無毒，李氏小寒，為藥中將軍。或生蜀郡北部，或隴西，二月卷生，生黃赤葉，四四相當。黃茎高三尺許。三月華黃，五月實黑。三月彩根，根有黃汁，切，陰乾。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○石斛","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"盛弘之《荆州記》曰：隋郡永陽縣有龍石山，山上多石斛，精好，如金環也。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《庐山記》曰：石門山，石間多生石斛。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：石斛池轹陆安。","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：石斛，一名林蘭，一名禁生。味甘平。生山穀。治傷中、下氣、虛勞，補五臟羸瘦。久服，除痹、厚腸胃，強陰。池轹祟安。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：石斛，神農甘平，扁鵲酸，李氏寒。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○半夏","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《禮記·月令》曰：仲夏之月，半夏生。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：半夏出三辅，色白者善。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣州記》曰：鄣平縣出半夏。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出半夏，極精。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：一名地文水玉，味辛平，生川穀，生槐里。","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：半夏，一名和姑。生微丘，或生野中。葉三三相偶。二月始生，白華員上。","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○射幹(射音夜)","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：鹿廉、鳶尾、乌莲，射幹也。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《易通卦验》曰：冬至射幹生。","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《抱朴子》曰：千歲之射幹，其根如生人，長七尺，刺之有血。以其血途足下，可步行水上，不没；以途人鼻，入水，水為之开；以途足耳，則隱形，欲見則拭去之。","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《孫卿子》曰：西方有木，名曰射幹，茎長四寸，生於高山之上，臨百仞之淵。木茎非能長也，所立者然也。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：射幹，根如安定。","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出射幹。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：射幹，一名乌扇，一名乌蒲。味苦辛。生川穀。治咳逆上氣。生南陽。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：射幹，一名黃遠。","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○蓪草","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：下父、附支，蓪草也。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：通草，一名附支。味辛平。生山穀。去惡虫，除脾胃寒熱，利九竅血脈關節，不忘。生石城。","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出通草。","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：通草出三辅。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：蓪草，一名丁翁，一名附支。神農、黃帝辛，雷公苦。生石城山穀。葉青蔓延，止汗。自正月彩。","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○牛膝","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：牛茎，牛膝也。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：牛膝，一名百倍。味苦辛。生川穀。治傷寒濕痿痹、四肢拘挛、膝痛不可屈伸。久服，輕身能老。生河內。","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出牛膝。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：牛膝，神農甘，一經酸，黃帝、扁鵲甘，李氏溫，雷公酸，無毒。生河內，或臨邛。葉如夏藍，茎本赤。二月、八月彩。","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○牡丹","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：白術，牡丹也。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：牡丹，出漢中、河內，赤色者亦善。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《遊名山志》曰：泉山多牡丹。","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：牡丹，一名鹿韭，一名鼠姑。味辛寒。生山穀。治寒熱症傷，中風驚邪，安五藏。出巴兢。","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：牡丹，神農、歧伯辛，季氏小寒，雷公、桐君苦，無毒，黃帝苦，有毒。葉如蓬，相值，黃色。根如指，黑，中有毒核。二月、八月彩，日乾。可食之，輕身益寿。","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○茵芋","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：茵芋，一名卑山共。微溫。有毒。状如莽草而細软。","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○獨活","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：獨活，一孟羌使者。味苦平。生益州。久服輕身。","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：獨活，一名胡王使者。神農、黃帝苦，無毒。八月彩此藥，有風花不動，無風獨搖。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○紫威","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：紫威，一名茇華，一名陵苕。味鹹微寒，無毒。生川穀。治婦人產乳餘疾、崩中、疝症、血寒熱，養胎。生西海。","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《建康記》曰：建康出紫威。","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：紫威出三辅。","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：紫威，一名武威，一名瞿夌，一名陵居腹，一明屙目，一名茇華。神農、雷公酸，歧伯辛，扁鵲苦鹹，黃帝甘，無毒。如夌根，黑。正月、八月彩。或生真定。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○大幹","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：荞，邛鉅。(郭璞症曰：今藥草大戟也。)","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：大幹，一滅睺鉅。","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○栝樓","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《毛詩·東山》曰：我來自東，零雨其濛。果臝之實，亦施於宇。(果臝，栝樓也。)","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"又《唐·蟋蟀·葛生》曰：蘝蔓於野。《詩義疏》曰：蘝，栝樓。","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：果臝之實栝樓。(今齊人呼之為天瓜。)","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：栝樓，一名地樓。味苦寒。生川穀。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：栝樓，一名泽巨，一名泽冶。","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○蕤核","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：蕤核，味甘溫。生川穀。主治心腹邪結氣，明目赤痛傷、淚出、目肿眦烂。久服，益氣輕身。生函穀。","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《晉宮閣記》曰：華林園，蕤三株。","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：蕤核，一名{艹是}。神農、雷够允，無毒，平。生池泽，八月彩。補中強中強志，明耳目，久服不飢。","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○地膚","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：地膚，一名地華，一名地脈，一名地菜。","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○貝母","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《毛詩·鄘·柏舟·載馳》曰：陟陂阿丘，言彩其{亡虫}。({亡虫}，貝母也。)","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：莔，(音{艹虫})貝母也。(郭璞註曰：根如小貝，員而白，華葉似韭。)","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《說文》曰：莔，貝母也。","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○海藻","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：堋，海藻也。(藥草也。一名海萝，如亂發，生海中。荨音覃。)","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：海藻著頸下，破散結。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《廣雅》曰：海羅，海藻。","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○豕首","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：茢(音列。)薽，(音真。)豕首。(郭璞症曰：《本草經》曰：\"彘盧，一名蟾蠩蘭。\"匠箔東呼犭希首。)","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：豕首，一名剧草，一名蠡實。","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：一名泽藍，一名豕首。神農、黃帝甘辛，無毒。生冤句。五月彩。","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○當陆","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《爾雅》曰：蓫(音逐。){艹昜}(音陽。)馬尾也。(郭璞症曰：江東謂之當陆，關西為{艹昜}。)","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：商陆，一名夜乎。","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○败醬","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：败醬出三辅。","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：败醬似桔梗，其臭如败豆醬。","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○纶布","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：纶布，一名崑布。味酸寒，無毒。主十二种死曜、癭瘤聚結、氣瘻瘡。生東海。","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○石龍芮","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：石龍芮，出三辅。","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：龍芮，一名水薑苔。","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○蛇床","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草》曰：蛇床，一名蛇珠。","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《博物志》曰：蛇床亂蘼芜。","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"○雲實","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《本草經》曰：雲實，味辛溫。生川穀。治泄利脹癖，殺虫蠱毒，去邪惡。多食令人狂走。久服輕身，通神明。生河間。","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《范子計然》曰：雲實生三辅。","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《吳氏本草經》曰：雲實，一名員實，一名天豆。神農辛，小溫，黃帝鹹，雷公苦。葉如麻，兩兩相值，高四五尺，大茎空中。六月花，八月、九月實，十月彩。","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tbnl_992_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tbnl_992","text":"《太平御覽》　宋·李昉","sortOrder":153}],"overrides":{}}